 er grow old. Never die. It's fun to be a vampire! When newly-divorced Lucy
  (Dianne Wiest) moves her sons to her father's house in Santa Carla\, Cali
 fornia—"the murder capital of the world"—her teenage son\, Michael (Ja
 son Patric)\, quickly falls in with the town's bad kids: a bike-riding\, J
 im Morrison-worshipping gang of blood-sucking vampires. Her younger son Sa
 m (Corey Haim) and his buddies are the only ones who recognize the signs o
 f vampirism in Michael\, and they plot to battle the legions of the night 
