SUMMARY:Prince of Darkness
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Master of horror John Carpenter (Halloween\, The Thing) directs
  this terrifying battle between humankind and ultimate evil. A group of gr
 aduate students and scientists uncover an ancient canister in an abandoned
  church\, but when they open the container\, they inadvertently unleash a 
 strange liquid and an evil force on all humanity. As the liquid turns thei
 r co-workers into zombies\, the remaining members realize they have releas
 ed the most unspeakable of horrors\, Satan himself\, thus paving the way f
 or the return of his father — the all-powerful anti-God. Terror mounts a
 s the last two members of the team must fight to save an innocent world fr
 om a devilish fury that has festered for over seven million years.\nhttps:
 //booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/b08fcc47-a945-5407-a69d-ae
 85d01c0123\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/b08fcc47-a945-540
 7-a69d-ae85d01c0123
